+# iBeacon example
+
+Non-connectable Apple iBeacon advertise via `gd32v_ble.ibeacon_advertise`.
+
+Needs [`GD32VW55x_WiFi_BLE_SDK`](https://github.com/GigaDeviceSemiconductor/GD32VW55x_WiFi_BLE_SDK)
+on the include/link path (same as other BLE examples).
+
+Before shipping iBeacon, see https://developer.apple.com/ibeacon/ for licensing.
+
+```sh
+make emit KLIN=/path/to/klin/bin/klin.dart
+```
